{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓星宋慧喬相隔3年再戰韓劇界，夥拍孔劉合演製作費高達800億韓圜（約4.67億港元）的重頭劇《夢響年代》，將於下月11日登陸串流平台，合共22集，首8集於下月11日播出，第9至15集將於同月18日播出，最後7集則會於25日播出。</p><p>&lt;br</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T04:07:49.502232+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T03:42:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T04:01:13.313250+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T04:01:13.313250+00:00","content_hash":"57843f2a36414d717700978c7524a96df6b202d2ef290048e884b10418dad065","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}